{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"GHSA-9qj4-v6r6-3wmx","published":"2026-06-30T12:31:52Z","modified":"2026-11-04T16:26:03.579683188Z","aliases":["BIT-activemq-2026-50750","CVE-2026-50750"],"summary":"Apache ActiveMQ Broker, Apache ActiveMQ, Apache ActiveMQ All have a Denial of Service via Out of Memory vulnerability","details":"Denial of Service via Out of Memory vulnerability in Apache ActiveMQ Broker, Apache ActiveMQ, Apache ActiveMQ All.\n\nFollowing the fix for  CVE-2026-49270 an unauthenticated attacker can now cause broker OOM by sending an repeated BrokerInfo commands without sending a ConnectionInfo, until the broker will crash with OOM.\nThis issue affects Apache ActiveMQ Broker: from 5.19.7 before 5.19.8, from 6.2.6 before 6.2.7; Apache ActiveMQ: from 5.19.7 before 5.19.8, from 6.2.6 before 6.2.7; Apache ActiveMQ All: from 5.19.7 before 5.19.8, from 6.2.6 before 6.2.7.\n\nUsers are recommended to upgrade to version 6.2.7, which fixes the issue.","affected":[{"package":{"name":"org.apache.activemq:activemq-broker","ecosystem":"Maven","purl":"pkg:maven/org.apache.activemq/activemq-broker"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"5.19.7"},{"fixed":"5.19.8"}]}],"versions":["5.19.7"],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/main/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/06/GHSA-9qj4-v6r6-3wmx/GHSA-9qj4-v6r6-3wmx.json"}},{"package":{"name":"org.apache.activemq:activemq-broker","ecosystem":"Maven","purl":"pkg:maven/org.apache.activemq/activemq-broker"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"6.2.6"},{"fixed":"6.2.7"}]}],"versions":["6.2.6"],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/main/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/06/GHSA-9qj4-v6r6-3wmx/GHSA-9qj4-v6r6-3wmx.json"}},{"package":{"name":"org.apache.activemq:apache-activemq","ecosystem":"Maven","purl":"pkg:maven/org.apache.activemq/apache-activemq"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"5.19.7"},{"fixed"